== basic
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: MAIL FROM:<a@example.com> BODY=8BITMIME\r
C: RCPT TO:<b@example.org>\r
C: DATA\r
D: From: a@example.com\r\nTo: b@example.org\r\nSubject: hi\r\n\r\nhello\r\n.\r\n
C: QUIT\r
=> ok
== two-recipients
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: MAIL FROM:<a@example.com> BODY=8BITMIME\r
C: RCPT TO:<b@example.org>\r
C: RCPT TO:<c@example.net>\r
C: DATA\r
D: From: a@example.com\r\nTo: b@example.org\r\nSubject: hi\r\n\r\nhello\r\n.\r\n
C: QUIT\r
=> ok
== helo-fallback
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: HELO localhost\r
C: MAIL FROM:<a@example.com>\r
C: RCPT TO:<b@example.org>\r
C: DATA\r
D: From: a@example.com\r\nTo: b@example.org\r\nSubject: hi\r\n\r\nhello\r\n.\r\n
C: QUIT\r
=> ok
== ehlo-fails-helo-fails
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: HELO localhost\r
=> error: 500 "no helo either"
