== auth-plain
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: AUTH PLAIN AHVzZXIAcGE1NXdvcmQ=\r
C: MAIL FROM:<a@example.com> BODY=8BITMIME\r
C: RCPT TO:<b@example.org>\r
C: DATA\r
D: From: a@example.com\r\nTo: b@example.org\r\nSubject: hi\r\n\r\nhello\r\n.\r\n
C: QUIT\r
=> ok
== auth-plain-refused
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: AUTH PLAIN AHVzZXIAYmFk\r
C: *\r
C: QUIT\r
=> error: 535 "5.7.8 Authentication credentials invalid"
== auth-plain-challenge
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: AUTH PLAIN AHVzZXIAcHc=\r
C: *\r
C: QUIT\r
=> error: unexpected server challenge
== auth-plain-no-auth-ext
C: EHLO localhost\r
=> error: smtp: server doesn't support AUTH
