C: MAIL FROM:<a@example.com>\r
C: RCPT TO:<b@example.org>\r
C: DATA\r
D: From: a@example.com\r\nTo: b@example.org\r\nSubject: hi\r\n\r\nhello\r\n.\r\n
C: QUIT\r
=> ok
== auth-login
C: EHLO localhost\r
C: AUTH LOGIN\r
C: dXNlcg==\r
C: c2VjcmV0\r
C: MAIL FROM:<a@example.com>\r
C: RCPT TO:<b@example.org>\r
C: DATA\r
D: From: a@example.com\r\nTo: b@example.org\r\nSubject: hi\r\n\r\nhello\r\n.\r\n
C: QUIT\r
=> ok
== auth-login-too-many-challenges
